   "summary": "This document comprises tables listing educational institutions across Saga Prefecture, recording founding dates, male, female, and total enrollment, and teacher counts as of April 30 and November 30, 1946. It encompasses municipal elementary schools and kindergartens, private agricultural, practical, middle, and girls' high schools, company- and community-affiliated youth schools, and vocational institutes operated under non-educational ministries such as Transportation and Home Affairs. The roster concludes with aggregate statistical summaries and a reference map of Kyushu showing prefectural capitals, population centers over 100,000, and institutions of higher learning.",
